; Tabitha, sketch G "Vendetta": A minor, 136 bpm. A dark orchestral drive: horns carry a rising menacing hook over a driving string ostinato of sixteenths, a pick bass and timpani stomp, a flat second (Bb) in the turn. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
